#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:119
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Across the top is a menubar. The menubar will provide you with quick "
#| "access to most of &infocenter;'s features. The menus are detailed in "
#| "<link linkend=\"info-center-menus\">The &kde; Info Center Menus</link>."
